Description: Free, private, offline voice dictation
 Hold a shortcut, speak naturally, and Straight cleans up your words and
 types them into the app in front of you. Everything — speech recognition,
 text cleanup, storage — runs locally on this computer. No account, no
 cloud, no subscription.
